# AI Job Tracker

A full-stack job application tracker with a drag-and-drop Kanban board, a stats dashboard, and an AI resume-vs-job-description match score powered by the Gemini API.

**Live demo:** https://ai-job-tracker1.vercel.app
**API:** https://ai-job-tracker1-tb95.onrender.com/api

> The app runs on free hosting. If it has been idle, the first request can take up to a minute while the server and database wake up. Please wait and refresh once.

**Demo account:** username `demo`, password `demo1234` (or register your own in a few seconds).

