## Project structure

```
.
├── backend/
│   ├── config/          # settings, root URLs, WSGI
│   ├── users/           # registration
│   ├── applications/    # Application model, serializer, ViewSet, stats
│   ├── ai/              # Gemini match endpoint
│   ├── certs/           # CA certificate for the managed MySQL connection
│   ├── manage.py
│   └── requirements.txt
└── frontend/
    ├── app/             # routes: login, register, board, ai, dashboard
    ├── components/      # AuthForm
    └── lib/             # Axios client with JWT interceptors, shared types
```

